Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Omnio bundles open-source software from other authors, each under its own
license. Their terms continue to apply to those components, and nothing here
replaces them. Notable engines include pdf.js and MuPDF for reading documents,
qpdf for rebuilding them, Tesseract for reading text in scans, and LibreOffice
for converting office documents on the server.
